- open your gallery from your phone or another computer's browser. turn it on in settings > remote access, then pair with a one-time code
- https option for remote access. it's recommended and makes thumbnails load faster
- long press on your phone to share, copy, download, or find similar images
- add a nicegal shortcut to your phone's home screen
- minimize or close to tray, and open when you sign in, so your phone can connect anytime
- search by file type with ext:jpg,png, and leave things out with !ext:gif or !path:old
- use * and ? in path: and name: searches, like name:IMG_*.jpg
